     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : CarteDeConcepts FRSectionLaboratorySupportingInformationLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"FRSectionLaboratorySupportingInformationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"hcFRSectionLaboratorySupportingInformationLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Groupe 1 </b>Mapping de <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.html\">Logical model - FR LM Laboratory Supporting Informationversion : 0.1.0)</a> to <code>https://interop.esante.gouv.fr/ig/cda/document-core/StructureDefinition/fr-cda-section-informations-cliniques</code></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Code source</b></td><td><b>relation</b></td><td><b>Code cible</b></td><td><b>Commentaire</b></td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation (Logical model - FR LM Laboratory Supporting Information)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section (FRCDASectionInformationsCliniques)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.codeSection (Code de la section)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.code</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.titleSection (Titre de la section)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.title</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.description (Bloc narratif)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.text</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.observation (Résultats cliniques et autres observations)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry.observation (FRCDASimpleObservation)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.condition (Problèmes)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry.observation (FRCDAProbleme)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.medicationAdministration (Produits de santé administré avant l'examen de biologie)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry.substanceAdministration (FRCDATraitement)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.sexForClinicalUse (Sexe Clinique)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune cible CDA explicite identifiée dans FRCDASectionInformationsCliniques pour FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.sexForClinicalUse ; cette donnée relève du contexte patient.</td></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.vaccination (Historique vaccinal du patient)</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#concept-map-equivalence-equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td>Section.entry.substanceAdministration (FRCDAVaccination)</td><td/></tr><tr><td>FRLMLaboratorySupportingInformation.entry.otherSupportingInformation (Autres informations cliniques pertinentes)</td><td colspan=\"2\" style=\"background-color: #efefef\">(not mapped)</td><td style=\"background-color: #efefef\">Aucune cible CDA explicite i